## 3. Critical Status Breakdown

### ✅ Alpha Features (Progress Report)
*Source: [ALPHA_PROGRESS_FEB8.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/ALPHA_PROGRESS_FEB8.md)*

| Feature | Status | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Daily Content System** | ✅ **DONE** | API & UI complete. Database populated. |
| **Thuthimal Badges** | ✅ **DONE** | "Gratitude Economy" logic implemented. |
| **Auth Redesign** | ✅ **DONE** | Simplified login/signup flow. |
| **Onboarding Flow** | 🔄 **Started** | "Fail-safe" approach planned. |
| **Student Bulk Create** | 🔄 **Started** | OCR + Manual fallback strategy. |
| **Photo Uploads** | ⏳ **Pending** | Needs Principal sharing logic. |

### ⛔ Beta Blockers (Technical Debt)
*Source: [ACTION_ITEMS.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/ACTION_ITEMS.md) & [BETA_RELEASE_ASSESSMENT.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/BETA_RELEASE_ASSESSMENT.md)*

You **cannot** skip these if you want a working app.

1.  **TypeScript Errors (Critical):** 13+ compilation errors. The app currently *does not build* cleanly.
2.  **Accessibility (Legal/Ethical):** 0% compliance. Buttons and inputs lack labels for screen readers.
3.  **Security (Data):** API endpoints lack authorization checks. (e.g., A student could theoretically fetch teacher notes).
4.  **Performance:** Large lists (Students, Grades) use `ScrollView` instead of `FlatList`, causing crashes on older devices.

